{
  "summary": "This experiment tested adding image modalities (resnet50) with concat fusion to the RNA-only scvi_n200 baseline (config_004), resulting in lower validation accuracy (0.6315) and F1 (0.6068) compared to the RNA-only baseline (0.6501/0.6275). The result suggests multimodal components may not improve performance in this setup, though uncertainty remains about the impact of fusion method or image encoder choice, as no direct comparisons with alternative multimodal configurations have been made."
}

